            "title": "Example: Eliminate duplicates",
            "id": 89421,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń duplikaty z <code>drinks_list</code> za pomocą instrukcji <code>set()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"drinks_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;espresso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;americano&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(set(drinks_list))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'chai', 'americano', 'espresso', 'matcha'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>set</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, a potem <code>drinks_list</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl każdy napój z <code>drinks_list</code> tylko raz, przekształcając listę.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"drinks_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;espresso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;americano&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(set(drinks_list))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tuple\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>set</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, <code>drinks_list</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
