            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz zmienną <code>drinks_set</code>, która przechowuje wynik zastosowania <code>set()</code> do <code>drinks_list</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"drinks_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;espresso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;americano&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"drinks_set = set(drinks_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(drinks_set)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'matcha', 'americano', 'chai', 'espresso'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>drinks_set</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, a potem <code>set</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>drinks_list</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zapisz każdy napój z <code>drinks_list</code> tylko raz w <code>drinks_set</code>, a następnie wyświetl ten zbiór.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"drinks_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;espresso&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;americano&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chai&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;matcha&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"drinks_set = set(drinks_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(drinks_set)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tuple\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>drinks_set</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, <code>set</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>drinks_list</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
